  "id": "therapeutic-community",
  "term": "therapeutic community",
  "definition": "A therapeutic community is a psychotherapeutic approach that uses the social environment and relationships between people to support a person’s resocialization and rehabilitation. It is usually based in a hospital ward or unit where both professional and nonprofessional staff interact with patients as part of the therapeutic setting.",
